`,i.jsx(n.p,{children:"Suppose we wanted to create a videogame in which a hero fights a villain. Additionally, our hero will fight a random villain each time we start a new fight.  However, the random villain should be chosen only once the fight has commenced so that the hero can’t cheat prior to the fight. How would we go about setting up this game? …with a closure!"}),`
